# The build context of hack/remote-cache/engine.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads the
# ignore file next to the Dockerfile, not the root's). The context is the
# repository root; this keeps it to the packages the engine, dagger-init,
# dagger-init-session and the CLI build from:
#
#   go list -tags dfexcludepatterns,dfparents -deps ./cmd/engine ./cmd/init ./cmd/init-session ./cmd/dagger | grep ^github.com/dagger/dagger/
#
# plus sdk/go, which go.mod replaces dagger.io/dagger with. If they start
# importing a package outside these directories, add it here: the image build
# then fails with "no required module provides package" or "is replaced but
# not required".
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!analytics
!auth
!cmd/codegen/introspection
!cmd/dagger
!cmd/engine
!cmd/init
!cmd/init-session
!core
!dagql
!engine
!internal
!network
!sdk/go
!util
# Not needed to build the binaries.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
**/*.md
# Markdown the binaries embed (grep -rn '^//go:embed' in the directories
# above).
!internal/cmd/dagger/llm_compact.md
!internal/cmd/dagger/llm_branch_summary.md
!core/skills/dang-dagger-modules/**
